    "rationale": "No exact solution exists under the stated ray semantics. Source-colour painting cannot create intersection colour 2 when no source is 2; fixed painting with colour 2 would also recolour every other ray cell. These tensors enable the missing colour-8 source but cannot implement intersection recolouring."
